      <activity id="f8d4686f-9e94-5311-84e9-a396f2722ed2" activityNameId="970e80b6-ca30-5d72-b7d2-a039e264b64e" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Chipper, mobile, diesel</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Chipper, mobile, diesel
This machine consists of a carrier vehicle of 20 t and of the chipper itself of 4 t. The chipper has an average service life of 10 years, the carrier vehicle of 20 years. Total weight includes 6 rubber-tyres of 300 kg each and cutting knives made of low-alloyed steel with a to-tal weight of 60 kg. The rubber-tyres have a service life of 5 years;
UUID: 1ff424db-987f-3a23-b48e-82ec2d47c858
The material (production and disposal) and their transports needed for a mobile chipper
Location: Data for Switzerland used for central Europe
Technology: carrier with chipper
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_1ff424db-987f-3a23-b48e-82ec2d47c858.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
